00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:41.120
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

496
00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:41.440
Yeah.
是的。

497
00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:46.180
And that I heard a story that like at one point the business next door came over and
我听说过一个故事，说有一次隔壁的公司跑过来

